      "created_at": "2012-01-28T20:29:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don’t know about anyone else, and I know all of you at &gt;G are still very busy, but I must say that I for one am really very hungry for some honest to goodness comic book pages. I appreciate all the flavor text and hints we’ve been given, but am honestly ready to dig into some solid comic book action as well. Would something like a page a week be possible?</p>",
