      "created_at": "2012-01-29T13:36:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This was brought up in a topic once before, and if I recall it did recieve a lot of demands. Now I may not be a member of &gt;G nor have I ever ran a business, but I think they may be pretty busy writing up everything for future expansions as well as wrapping up Rook City. So my theory is they may takea  year or so before they actually put a comic into motion and it’ll be well worth the wait.</p>",
